&lt;p&gt;SingleStore values individuals for their unique skills and experiences, and we’re proud to offer roles in a variety of locations across the United States. Salary is based on permissible, non-discriminatory factors such as skills, experience, and geographic location, and is just one part of our total compensation and benefits package. Certain roles are also eligible for additional rewards, including merit increases and annual bonuses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SingleStore’s base salary range for this role, if based in States: $120,000-&amp;nbsp; $200,000 USD per year&lt;/p&gt;
