&lt;p&gt;We look forward to connecting with you.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;Senior Account Executive – India&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Position Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;SingleStore is transforming how modern applications are built and powered by data. Our real-time data platform enables organizations to transact, analyze, and act on data in a single system, helping businesses move faster and build differentiated applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Account&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Executive &lt;/strong&gt;to take ownership of our growing India market. This is a high-impact, hands-on sales opportunity to shape the next phase of SingleStore’s growth in one of the world’s most dynamic technology markets. You are not starting from zero. SingleStore has an established presence in India, with a growing customer base, strong market traction, and meaningful opportunities across renewals, expansion, and new business. You will inherit a fertile territory while having the autonomy to build pipeline, win new logos, and expand our footprint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;India is experiencing significant growth in AI, real-time data, and modern data infrastructure. You will have the opportunity to sell SingleStore to some of the largest enterprises in India, while also working with innovative, digitally native technology companies. This role is initially a hands-on individual contributor position, with significant potential to grow into a leadership opportunity. As the India business scales, the successful candidate will have the opportunity to help build the sales organization, hire additional talent, and potentially grow into a broader India sales leadership role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own and execute the India sales strategy, delivering against revenue and bookings targets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build pipeline through strategic prospecting, new logo acquisition, partners, referrals, and account development.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Manage the full sales cycle from discovery and qualification through negotiation and close.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Win new enterprise and strategic accounts while expanding existing customer relationships through upsell and cross-sell opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior business and technology leaders, including CIOs, CTOs, data leaders, engineering leaders, and architects.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Sell across a diverse customer base, from large enterprises to digitally native and technology-forward companies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner closely with Sales Engineering, SDRs, Marketing, Customer Success, Product, and technology partners to drive successful outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop account strategies and maintain accurate pipeline, opportunity, and forecast information in Salesforce.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Operate with a high degree of autonomy and a builder mentality, taking ownership in a fast-moving, entrepreneurial environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As the business grows, contribute to hiring and mentoring additional sales talent, with the potential to take on broader leadership responsibilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
